  m_Text: Most ammunition belong to this category. Bullets of supersonic ammunition have velocities higher than the speed of sound. Firing this type of ammunition produces very loud bangs because the bullets produce extra sound - so called sonic booms or supersonic cracks - when they break the sound barrier.
