    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: FMJ bullets will almost always go all the way through walls, doors and tissue and keep going on the other side. FMJ bullets are good at penetration. They are better suited against armored targets than JHP rounds are. On unarmored targets they do less damage than JHP since they leave a smaller wound channel as a result of their lesser expansion.
