    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "Stun grenades are used to distract occupants from engaging the team operators as they enter rooms and buildings.\n\nIndividuals inside the blast range suffer temporary visual and auditory perception loss. They become less able to see and hear.\n\nIt is worth noting that stun grenades are not harmless. Their blast can cause loss of consciousness. They can also cause trauma to nearby tissue. Individuals lying down are especially vulnerable to such trauma."
