    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: Subsonic ammunition is very quiet compared to the supersonic counterpart. To make a firearm anywhere near quiet enough to remain undetected, it must not only be equipped with a suppressor but also use subsonic ammunition. Subsonic bullets' ability to deliver trauma is inhibited by their lower velocity. This can to some extent be compensated for by increasing the mass of the bullets.
